===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|head=[[brush]] [[off]]}}

# {{&lit|brush|off|lang=en}} To [[remove]] something with a [[brush]].
# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} To [[disregard]] (something), to [[dismiss]] or [[ignore]] (someone), as unimportant.
#* {{RQ:Wodehouse Offing|XVIII|Again I begged her to keep an eye on her blood pressure and not get so worked up, and once more she '''brushed me off''', this time with a curt request that I would go and boil my head.}}
# To [[depart]] with a sweeping motion.
#* Goldsmith
#*: Snatching his hat, he '''brushed''' off like the wind.

